This PR remains Draft until fresh exact-head semantic review and final target-Windows/hosted acceptance pass.

## Preserved boundaries

The generic Delegation foundation remains provider-neutral. `worker_profile` is part of deterministic delegation identity; the first physical `chatgpt-temporary` adapter remains strictly limited to `fresh_readonly_worker_v1`.

- ordinary ChatGPT remains the only current general planner;
- Control Plane / WorkingState / Verification Kernel / Finish Gate remain project-owned authority;
- exactly six public semantic tools remain unchanged;
- no generic scheduler/event bus;
- no same-task automatic parent wake/resampling;
- no nested/fan-out workers;
- no mutating child worker;
- no rich-context/persistent worker implementation;
- no Prime implementation;
- no provider-conversation recovery;
- accepted independent-review procedures remain unchanged.

