   - **A normal run:** neutral preflight -> authenticated exact controller -> same-tab task navigation -> fresh non-personalized Temporary Chat -> exact archived/runtime provenance -> exactly one Send -> delivered -> genuine correlated `WORKER_RESULT_V1` captured/recorded;
   - **B1 pre-first-claim browser loss:** committed task navigation -> complete Chrome loss before first browser claim -> restored opaque handle in new MV3 lifetime cannot resolve -> zero browser claim/controller/Send authority;
   - **B2 post-claim browser loss:** first browser claim exists -> complete Chrome loss -> no recovered Send/monitor authority -> zero second Send -> durable state remains exact/fail-closed unless result was already recorded;
5. run final exact-head hosted CI, re-resolve BASE/HEAD unchanged, mark ready and merge only while review/physical/CI evidence remains current.

Persistent ordinary-ChatGPT conversation identity, browser wake and cross-restart Existing-Session Delivery remain separate future research after #149 and the parked Prime ownership decision.
